{"id":"91088925c254ba07","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Equivalence Saturation","display":"df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation — ZFC Set12 Equivalence Saturation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation — ZFC Set12 Equivalence Saturation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-equivalence-saturation — ZFC Set12 Equivalence Saturation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,A,E,X\\in V\">\\(S,A,E,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> is the equivalence-relation predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> is the ordered-pair code (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}saturation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S(S,A,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=\\{y\\in X:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E)\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}saturation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S(S,A,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=\\{y\\in X:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E)\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the union of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>-equivalence classes meeting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, bounded by the carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S$ is the equivalence-relation predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle x,y\\rangle$ is the ordered-pair code (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,A,E,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}saturation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12EquivalenceSaturation}_S(S,A,E)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land S=\\{y\\in X:\\exists x\\in A\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E)\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"E","